      "severity": "must",
      "text": "Filtering bridge and kind-rule goals by the same tag list drops a kind rule’s own `valid` premise, so Lean rejects the resulting proof with an unresolved metavariable. Fix: Track handled goals by `MVarId`, return every other unassigned goal, and test a rule whose premise shares a bridge tag."
